		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">8</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Using internet is an integral part of software development and it is a skill you must learn. Simply searching on internet is not sufficient. Internet will throw a huge amount of information at you. You cannot go through all of that. You should be able to quickly figure out which is relevant and which is not. That, you can learn only through practice.</attribute>
