		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">59</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are some hints for coming up with new test cases.
1. Normal test cases - number of points is like 5, 8, 10 etc.
1.a. There is at least 1 point from each quadrant
2. Boundary test cases
2.a. Input contains only 1 point
2.b. Input contains multiple points, but all of them belong to the same quadrant
2.c. Input contains multiple points, but all of the points are same

Based on these hints, you can come up with at least 4 new test cases.

Write them on a paper.</attribute>
