		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">66</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">I need to predict which qudrant it belongs to. There are 4 conditions given in the problem description, one for each quadrant. I started checking quadrant by quadrant.

Check if the point belongs to Q1
If yes, then we know that the answer is Q1
Otherwise, check if the point belongs to Q2
If yes, then we know that the answer is Q2
Otherwise, check if the point belongs to Q3
If yes, then we know that the answer is Q3
Otherwise, we know that the answer is Q4

When I followed this on a paper, I found that "84 -7" belongs to Q4.
I wrote Q4 on the paper.</attribute>
