		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">70</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following is what I came up with.
1. Read the first line which contains the number of points
2. Read a point and store its x co-ordinate and y co-ordinate
3. Check if x > 0 and y > 0
4. If yes, then print Q1
5. Otherwise, check if x &lt; 0 and y > 0
6. If yes, then print Q2
7. Otherwise, check if x &lt; 0 and y &lt; 0
8. If yes, then print Q3
9. Otherwise, print Q4
10. Repeat steps 2 to 9 until you process the given number of points</attribute>
