			<attribute key="id" type="int">74</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Let us convert the algorithm step by step.

There are various things to be implemented.
a. Taking input as an integer (step 1)
b. Creating new variables (steps 1 and 2)
c. Read 2 values from one line of input (step 2)
d. Compare two values (steps 3, 5 and 7)
e. Take different actions based on a condition (steps 3 to 9)
f. Displaying output (steps 4, 6, 8, 9)
g. Repeat a set of steps for a given number of times (step 10)

We have discussed all of the above in previous assignments multiple times, except c (viz. Read 2 values from one line of input (step 2)).</attribute>
